      <div>
        <span class="lat" dir="ltr" style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:4px;text-align:start">Good Manufacturing Practice</span>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--muted)">Good manufacturing practice: requirements that keep production quality consistent from batch to batch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:20px 26px" class="cert-row">
      <b class="lat" dir="ltr" style="font-size:21px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green-900);text-align:center;background:var(--mint);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 8px">MFDS</b>
      <div>
        <span class="lat" dir="ltr" style="display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:4px;text-align:start">Ministry of Food and Drug Safety — formerly KFDA</span>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.95;color:var(--muted)">The Korean regulator’s licence in the country of origin — the product is approved for circulation where it is made.</p>
      </div>
